    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d845">

                <pb facs="0785" n="669" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg669"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/14552.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Special Agent
                    Silliman</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-03-11T18:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 11, 1915—6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Answering your March 10, 4 p.m., the various representatives bring the troubles
                    of their nationals to us and we have been anxious to do all we could to help
                    them, but if our efforts provoke protest <pb facs="0786" n="670" xml:id="pg670"
                    /> from Carranza it is better to have the effort made through local
                    representatives of their nations. You will however please assist these local
                    representatives by counsel and advise and in any other way possible.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
